X
X	Prerequisites:
X
X		1) An unmodified copy of the 1.0.3 sources.
X		2) An MSDOS machine with >=512k RAM and lots
X		   of (hard) disk space for the sources.
X		3) A copy of the MicroSoft C Compiler Version 3.0
